<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 145 0 R
/E (To organize outstanding events, one must be familiar with all the basics of crowd management. A temporary gathering of a large group of people in the same place \(usually in public spaces\) at the same time for a specific purpose and performing the same behavior or action can turn the group into a crowd by taking a particular event, action, or reason to bring people together.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
